         [38;5;246mA runner, a test layout, and a first passing test. The storage logic has real edge cases (corrupt JSON, missing
[39m         [38;5;246mkeys) that are worth pinning down.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m [ ] Lint + auto-format (Recommended)
         [38;5;246mESLint + Prettier, the stack standard. Cheap now, tedious to retrofit.[39m
